    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I need to tell you one important thing. This vending machine is not equipped to differentiate between special items and ordinary items.",
      "translation" : "有件重要的事要告訴你。這臺自動販賣機無法區分特殊物品和普通物品。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Audi]",
      "translation" : "[奧迪]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So if you use an item that has been ^FF3355upgraded, or has a card compounded to it^000000, any cards or upgrades will be lost in creating the new item.",
      "translation" : "如果你使用了^FF3355經過精煉或插有卡片的物品^000000，製作新物品時，精煉和卡片都會消失。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Audi]",
      "translation" : "[奧迪]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So when you try to exchange and generate items, please put all the valuable items you won't be using into the Kafra Storage.",
      "translation" : "所以，兌換或製作物品之前，請把不打算使用的貴重物品存進卡普拉倉庫。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Audi]",
      "translation" : "[奧迪]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Vending Machine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please keep this in mind because this Vending Machine does not provide any returns, refunds or exchanges.",
